# TinaCMS credentials — https://app.tina.io (Project → Overview / Tokens)
# Astro uses the PUBLIC_ prefix, not Next.js's NEXT_PUBLIC_.
PUBLIC_TINA_CLIENT_ID=
TINA_TOKEN=

# Optional: override the production URL used by the Cloudflare adapter builds
# (sitemap/RSS/OpenGraph fall back to the `site` in astro.config.ts otherwise).
# SITE_URL=https://dalab.top

# Optional: allow the admin to postMessage into a site on another origin
# (Codespaces, separate-domain self-hosted admin). Comma-separate multiple.
# PUBLIC_TINA_ADMIN_ORIGIN=
